# Generated visual artifacts — Playwright/Storybook captures and print exports.
# These were untracked noise in `git status` (264 files) and 110MB on disk.
# Regenerate with `npm run test:visual` / `npm run capture:storybook`.
screenshots/
*.stackdump

# Kotlin compiler scratch — daemon session files and crash logs, written beside
# each module. Not build output under `build/`, so it escaped that rule.
.kotlin/
